== About me
I am an Assistant Professor at the Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (HKUST).
Previously, I was a postdoctoral researcher at Southern University of Science and Technology (SUSTech), hosted by [https://kailiang-wu.github.io/ Prof. Kailiang Wu] at the Department of Mathematics.
I received my Bachelor degrees in Aerospace Engineering and Mathematics from Tsinghua University in 2016, followed by a Diplôme d'Ingénieur and a PhD degree from Mines Paris – Université PSL. My PhD supervisors are Prof. Elie Hachem and [https://jviquerat.github.io/ Dr. Jonathan Viquerat].

{{<b>}} Research Interests {{</b>}} \n
Interscale structure in multiscale chaos\n
Deterministic and stochastic closure modeling for multiscale systems\n
Data-driven modeling of unknown governing equations\n
Surrogate modeling for computationally expensive partial differential equations\n

